<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" modified="2026-10-07T00:45:00.000Z" agent="MedShare Enterprise Architecture Modeler" version="21.0.0" type="device"><diagram id="page_arch" name="1. Kiến trúc Tổng thể &amp; 4 Vùng Tin cậy"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1860" pageHeight="1150" background="#F8FAFC" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="banner1" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;text-align:center;color:#0F172A;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:21px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.5px;color:#1E293B;'&gt;HỆ THỐNG BẢO VỆ DỮ LIỆU Y TẾ ĐA TENANT TRÊN CLOUD DBMS (MEDSHARE-LAB - TOPIC 18)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='margin-top:4px;font-size:12.5px;color:#475569;'&gt;Mô hình kiến trúc 4 vùng tin cậy (Z0-Z3) | Envelope Encryption (AES-256-GCM) | ABAC | Blind Index | Vault KMS | CP-ABE | SEAL BFV&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;arcSize=6;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1780" height="65" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="zone_z0" value="&lt;b&gt;VÙNG Z0: NGƯỜI DÙNG &amp;amp; THIẾT BỊ ĐẦU CUỐI (CLIENT ZONE)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0F9FF;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0369A1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="105" width="310" height="690" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="zone_z1" value="&lt;b&gt;VÙNG Z1: MIỀN TỔ CHỨC TIN CẬY (TRUSTED GATEWAY &amp;amp; KEY MANAGEMENT)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0FDF4;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#15803D;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="105" width="750" height="690" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="zone_z2" value="&lt;b&gt;VÙNG Z2: ĐÁM MÂY KHÔNG TIN CẬY (UNTRUSTED CLOUD DBMS &amp;amp; WORKERS)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#B91C1C;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="105" width="660" height="690" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="zone_z3" value="&lt;b&gt;VÙNG Z3: KIỂM TOÁN &amp;amp; GIÁM SÁT ĐỘC LẬP (INDEPENDENT AUDIT &amp;amp; GOVERNANCE)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#334155;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="815" width="1780" height="145" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_user" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#0284C7;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;Bác sĩ / Nhà nghiên cứu &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;ACTOR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Người dùng nghiệp vụ (Doctor/Nurse)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Gửi truy vấn đọc/ghi hồ sơ bệnh án&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Xác thực qua mTLS / OpenID Connect&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="65" y="150" width="260" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_portal" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#0284C7;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;MedShare Portal / EMR App &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;Z0 APP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Ứng dụng bệnh viện / Web Client&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Giao tiếp qua kênh an toàn TLS 1.3 (F1)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Gửi kèm JWT Bearer Token theo phiên&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="65" y="290" width="260" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_sdk" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#7C3AED;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;Recipient SDK (CP-ABE) &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;PROFILE P2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Engine giải mã chia sẻ liên viện&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Lưu giữ User Secret Keys theo thuộc tính&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Giải mã ngoại tuyến độc lập (Offline)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="65" y="450" width="260" height="115" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_viewer" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#0284C7;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;Safe Clinical Viewer &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;VIEWER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Trình hiển thị dữ liệu an toàn&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Chỉ render trường được PDP cấp phép&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Không lưu vết cache plaintext nhạy cảm&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="65" y="615" width="260" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_gateway" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#16A34A;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;Trusted Crypto Gateway &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;PEP / API&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Điểm tiếp nhận tập trung (API Entry Point)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Thực thi điểm chốt chính sách PEP&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Phân rã request &amp;amp; điều phối mã hóa&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="405" y="150" width="340" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_engine" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#16A34A;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;FieldCipherEngine &amp;amp; Blind Index &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;M-01/M-02&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Mã hóa AES-256-GCM (12-byte CSPRNG Nonce)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Ràng buộc AAD RFC 8785 (JCS Canonical)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Blind Index: HMAC-SHA256 Token (F4)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="405" y="290" width="340" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_broker" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#CA8A04;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;Key Broker &amp;amp; Independent PEP &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;PEP KEY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Quản lý vòng đời DEK phân cấp Tenant/Class&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Đối soát quyền truy cập khóa với PDP độc lập&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Ủy quyền bọc/gỡ DEK sang KMS (F0/F8)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="405" y="440" width="340" height="115" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_kms" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#CA8A04;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;Software KMS (HashiCorp Vault) &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;Z1 KMS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Transit Secret Engine (Port 8200)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Bảo vệ Master KEK &amp;amp; Tenant KEK&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Wrap/Unwrap DEK &amp;rarr; KeyCapsule an toàn&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="405" y="585" width="340" height="115" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_idp" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#15803D;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;Identity Provider (IdP) &amp;amp; PIP &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;IdP / PIP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Xác thực danh tính người dùng (OAuth2/JWT)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Cung cấp Policy Information Point (PIP)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Truy xuất thuộc tính: Vai trò, Khoa, Tenant&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="765" y="150" width="340" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_pdp" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#15803D;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;ABAC PDP (Policy Decision Point) &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;PDP CORE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Động cơ phân quyền Deny-by-Default&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Đánh giá Subject, Object, Action, Context&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Trả quyết định: Permit / Deny + Policy Ver&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="765" y="290" width="340" height="115" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_reg" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#15803D;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;Trusted Manifest Registry &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;REGISTRY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Quản lý Schema &amp;amp; Manifest các trường&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Theo dõi phiên bản KEK/DEK đang hoạt động&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Freshness Check chống tấn công Replay (F8)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="765" y="435" width="340" height="115" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_aa" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#7C3AED;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;Attribute Authority (CP-ABE) &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;AUTH AA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Nắm giữ Master Secret Key thuật toán AC17&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Cấp phát User Secret Key theo thuộc tính&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Phát hành Public Parameters cho bên chia sẻ&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="765" y="580" width="340" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_db" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#DC2626;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;Untrusted Cloud DBMS &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;SQL/NOSQL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;PostgreSQL 16 (5432) &amp;amp; MongoDB 7.0 (27017)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Lưu &lt;b&gt;FieldEnvelope&lt;/b&gt; (Ciphertext + Tag)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Lưu &lt;b&gt;KeyCapsule&lt;/b&gt; (Wrapped DEK bởi KEK)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Lưu &lt;b&gt;Blind Index&lt;/b&gt; (HMAC Token tra cứu)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1185" y="150" width="300" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_replica" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#DC2626;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;Cloud Replicas &amp;amp; Backups &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;BACKUP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Replication Streams (WAL / Oplog CDC)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Volume Snapshot đĩa cứng (LUKS Entropy 7.99)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Không rò rỉ Plaintext khi snapshot bị đánh cắp&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1185" y="320" width="300" height="115" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_he_worker" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#7C3AED;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;HE Worker (SEAL BFV) &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;PROFILE P3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Docker Container: Microsoft SEAL v4.1.2 C++&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Tính toán Encrypted Sum trên bản mã&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Không biết nội dung và không cần giải mã&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1185" y="475" width="300" height="115" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_threat" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#991B1B;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;Threat: Rogue DBA / Cloud Admin &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;ADVERSARY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Truy vấn trực tiếp DB: Chỉ thấy Base64 (TC-02)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Sửa bit / tráo AAD: Bị chặn bởi GCM Tag (TC-05)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Không thể giải mã vì không có KEK/DEK trong Z2&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1185" y="615" width="300" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_abe_worker" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#7C3AED;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;CP-ABE Worker (AC17) &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;AC17 WORKER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Stanford PBC 0.5.14 + Charm-Crypto&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Mã hóa DEK theo Policy cây thuộc tính&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Hỗ trợ chia sẻ hồ sơ liên viện an toàn&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1505" y="150" width="295" height="115" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_pqc_worker" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#475569;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;PQC Worker (liboqs) &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;PROFILE P4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;FIPS 203 ML-KEM-768 (KEM đóng gói)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;FIPS 204 ML-DSA-65 (Chữ ký điện tử)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Bảo vệ dài hạn chống mối đe dọa Lượng tử&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1505" y="295" width="295" height="115" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_pqc_arch" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#475569;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;PQC Long-Term Archival &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;P4 ARCHIVE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Kho lưu trữ hồ sơ bệnh án vĩnh viễn&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Chống tấn công Harvest-Now-Decrypt-Later&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Đóng gói an toàn kết hợp Hybrid KEM&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1505" y="440" width="295" height="115" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_sec_note" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#DC2626;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;Bảo đảm An toàn Z2 &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;GUARANTEE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Không bao giờ truyền KEK xuống Z2&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;DEK chỉ tồn tại trong RAM của Z1&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Nguyên tắc phòng thủ theo chiều sâu&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1505" y="590" width="295" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_audit_log" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#334155;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;Append-Only Audit Log &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;F9 AUDIT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Cấu trúc Merkle Tree Hash-Chained bất biến&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Ghi F9: &lt;code&gt;[op_id, subject_hash, policy_ver, kek_id, digest]&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Nghiêm cấm ghi Plaintext hoặc Key Material&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="850" width="520" height="95" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_witness" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#334155;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;External Checkpoint Witness &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;NOTARY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Ký số định kỳ trên Merkle Root Hash của Audit Log&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Lưu trữ mốc bằng chứng độc lập ngoài Cloud&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Chống chối bỏ và chống tấn công cắt tỉa nhật ký&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="650" y="850" width="520" height="95" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_siem" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#334155;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;Security SIEM &amp;amp; Tamper Monitor &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;SIEM ALERTS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Giám sát liên tục các sự kiện vi phạm toàn vẹn (TC-05)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Cảnh báo hành vi quét hàng loạt của Rogue DBA (TC-02)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Tự động kích hoạt phong tỏa khẩn cấp khi có sự cố&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1230" y="850" width="560" height="95" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e1_user_portal" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0369A1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="node_user" target="node_portal"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e1_portal_gw" value="F1: TLS 1.3 Request" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0369A1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="node_portal" target="node_gateway"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e1_gw_pdp" value="F2: Context Check" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#15803D;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="node_gateway" target="node_pdp"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e1_gw_engine" value="Plaintext / Fields" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#15803D;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="node_gateway" target="node_engine"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e1_engine_broker" value="Yêu cầu DEK" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#CA8A04;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#854D0E;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="node_engine" target="node_broker"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e1_broker_kms" value="Wrap DEK &amp;rarr; Capsule" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#CA8A04;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#854D0E;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="node_broker" target="node_kms"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e1_engine_db" value="F3/F4: Envelopes + Blind Index" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#991B1B;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="node_engine" target="node_db"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e1_db_replica" value="F7: Replication" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#991B1B;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="node_db" target="node_replica"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e1_aa_sdk" value="Cấp User Secret Key" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#6D28D9;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="node_aa" target="node_sdk"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e1_gw_audit" value="F9 Metadata" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontColor=#475569;fontSize=9;" parent="1" edge="1" source="node_gateway" target="node_audit_log"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e1_audit_wit" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontColor=#475569;fontSize=9;" parent="1" edge="1" source="node_audit_log" target="node_witness"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e1_wit_siem" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontColor=#475569;fontSize=9;" parent="1" edge="1" source="node_witness" target="node_siem"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="page_write" name="2. Luồng Ghi Hồ sơ (Write Pipeline)"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1860" pageHeight="1150" background="#F8FAFC" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="banner2" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;text-align:center;color:#0F172A;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:21px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.5px;color:#15803D;'&gt;QUY TRÌNH GHI HỒ SƠ &amp;amp; MÃ HÓA TẦNG TRƯỜNG (WRITE &amp;amp; INGESTION PIPELINE)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='margin-top:4px;font-size:12.5px;color:#475569;'&gt;Quy trình xử lý 7 bước từ Client (Z0) qua Gateway/KMS (Z1) đến Cloud DBMS (Z2) | Ràng buộc AAD RFC 8785 | Fail-Closed&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1780" height="65" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="wlane_z0" value="&lt;b&gt;VÙNG Z0: CLIENT ENDPOINT&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0F9FF;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0369A1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="105" width="340" height="980" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="wlane_z1" value="&lt;b&gt;VÙNG Z1: TRUSTED GATEWAY &amp;amp; KEY BROKER&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0FDF4;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#15803D;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="105" width="780" height="980" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="wlane_z2" value="&lt;b&gt;VÙNG Z2: UNTRUSTED CLOUD DBMS&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#B91C1C;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="105" width="350" height="980" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="wlane_z3" value="&lt;b&gt;VÙNG Z3: AUDIT&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#334155;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1600" y="105" width="220" height="980" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="w1" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#0284C7;color:#FFFFFF;padding:5px 8px;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;'&gt;&lt;span&gt;BƯỚC 1: Gửi Hồ sơ Bệnh án&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='background:rgba(0,0,0,0.18);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;EMR CLIENT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:7px 9px;font-size:10px;color:#334155;line-height:1.4;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;• Bác sĩ nhập hồ sơ bệnh án (Tên, CCCD, Chẩn đoán, Nhóm máu).&lt;br/&gt;• Gửi HTTP POST JSON qua kênh mã hóa &lt;b&gt;TLS 1.3&lt;/b&gt; kèm JWT token xác thực (F1).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="65" y="160" width="290" height="105" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="w2" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#16A34A;color:#FFFFFF;padding:5px 8px;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;'&gt;&lt;span&gt;BƯỚC 2: Xác thực &amp;amp; Kiểm tra ABAC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='background:rgba(0,0,0,0.18);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;GATEWAY &amp;amp; PDP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:7px 9px;font-size:10px;color:#334155;line-height:1.4;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;• Gateway trích xuất Subject: &lt;code&gt;doctor_id&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;role&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;tenant_id&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• Gửi yêu cầu sang &lt;b&gt;PDP&lt;/b&gt;: Đánh giá chính sách ABAC (Deny-by-default).&lt;br/&gt;• Nếu không hợp lệ &amp;rarr; Từ chối ngay (Fail-closed). Nếu hợp lệ &amp;rarr; Cho phép ghi.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="160" width="340" height="115" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="w3" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#CA8A04;color:#FFFFFF;padding:5px 8px;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;'&gt;&lt;span&gt;BƯỚC 3: Yêu cầu Cấp phát Khóa DEK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='background:rgba(0,0,0,0.18);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;KEY BROKER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:7px 9px;font-size:10px;color:#334155;line-height:1.4;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;• Gateway yêu cầu DEK tương ứng với cặp &lt;code&gt;(tenant_id, data_class)&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• Key Broker kiểm tra quyền độc lập, sinh ngẫu nhiên DEK 256-bit (CSPRNG).&lt;br/&gt;• DEK chỉ tồn tại trong bộ nhớ RAM tạm thời của Z1.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="810" y="160" width="350" height="115" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="w4" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#CA8A04;color:#FFFFFF;padding:5px 8px;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;'&gt;&lt;span&gt;BƯỚC 4: Bọc Khóa (Key Wrapping)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='background:rgba(0,0,0,0.18);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;VAULT KMS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:7px 9px;font-size:10px;color:#334155;line-height:1.4;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;• Key Broker gọi HashiCorp Vault Transit API qua cổng 8200.&lt;br/&gt;• Vault dùng Tenant KEK bọc DEK &amp;rarr; tạo ra &lt;code&gt;KeyCapsule&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;code&gt;KeyCapsule&lt;/code&gt; chứa: &lt;code&gt;kek_id&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;version&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;wrapped_dek_b64&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="810" y="350" width="350" height="115" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="w5" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#16A34A;color:#FFFFFF;padding:5px 8px;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;'&gt;&lt;span&gt;BƯỚC 5: Mã hóa Trường &amp;amp; Tính Blind Index&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='background:rgba(0,0,0,0.18);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;CRYPTO ENGINE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:7px 9px;font-size:10px;color:#334155;line-height:1.4;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;• &lt;b&gt;FieldCipherEngine&lt;/b&gt; mã hóa từng trường nhạy cảm bằng AES-256-GCM.&lt;br/&gt;• Tạo Nonce 12-byte CSPRNG duy nhất cho mỗi trường (chống nonce reuse).&lt;br/&gt;• Ràng buộc AAD theo chuẩn &lt;b&gt;RFC 8785 JCS&lt;/b&gt;: &lt;code&gt;tenant_id, object_id, field&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• Sinh Blind Index Token (HMAC-SHA256) cho các trường tra cứu chính xác.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="480" width="720" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="w6" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#DC2626;color:#FFFFFF;padding:5px 8px;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;'&gt;&lt;span&gt;BƯỚC 6: Lưu trữ Bản mã xuống Cloud DB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='background:rgba(0,0,0,0.18);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;CLOUD DBMS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:7px 9px;font-size:10px;color:#334155;line-height:1.4;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;• Gateway gửi bản ghi đã mã hóa xuống PostgreSQL 16 / MongoDB 7.0 (F3).&lt;br/&gt;• Dữ liệu lưu trữ gồm: &lt;code&gt;FieldEnvelope&lt;/code&gt; (Ciphertext + Tag + Salt),&lt;br/&gt;  &lt;code&gt;KeyCapsule&lt;/code&gt; (bọc bởi KEK), và &lt;code&gt;token_bidx_hmac&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Cloud DB KHÔNG CÓ Plaintext và KHÔNG CÓ KEK!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1245" y="480" width="300" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="w7" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#334155;color:#FFFFFF;padding:5px 8px;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;'&gt;&lt;span&gt;BƯỚC 7: Ghi Nhật ký Kiểm toán Bất biến&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='background:rgba(0,0,0,0.18);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;Z3 AUDIT LOG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:7px 9px;font-size:10px;color:#334155;line-height:1.4;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;• Gateway và Broker gửi Metadata F9 sang Audit Log.&lt;br/&gt;• Ghi lại: &lt;code&gt;op_id&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;subject_hash&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;kek_id&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;digest&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• Nối vào Merkle Hash Chain bất biến để phục vụ kiểm toán độc lập.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1620" y="480" width="180" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="we1" value="F1: Request TLS" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0369A1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="w1" target="w2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="we2" value="Quyền Ghi Hợp lệ" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#15803D;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="w2" target="w3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="we3" value="Wrap DEK" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#CA8A04;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#854D0E;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="w3" target="w4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="we4" value="DEK + KeyCapsule" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#CA8A04;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#854D0E;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="w4" target="w5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="we5" value="F3: Ghi Ciphertext Envelopes" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#991B1B;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="w5" target="w6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="we6" value="F9: Metadata Only" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontColor=#475569;fontSize=9;" parent="1" edge="1" source="w5" target="w7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="w_sec_box" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;padding:12px;color:#1E293B;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-weight:bold;color:#15803D;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:6px;'&gt;CAM KẾT AN TOÀN TRONG QUY TRÌNH GHI (SECURITY INVARIANTS)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:15px;'&gt;&lt;div&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Tính độc lập DEK:&lt;/b&gt; Mỗi trường/bản ghi sử dụng Nonce CSPRNG 12-byte duy nhất, ngăn chặn triệt để tấn công Replay và rò rỉ khóa.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Ràng buộc ngữ cảnh AAD (RFC 8785):&lt;/b&gt; Bất biến gắn liền với &lt;code&gt;tenant_id&lt;/code&gt;, ngăn chặn hoàn toàn việc tráo đổi dữ liệu giữa các bệnh viện (TC-05).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Cô lập khóa KEK:&lt;/b&gt; KEK được lưu trữ an toàn trong HashiCorp Vault KMS, không bao giờ được xuất ra ngoài RAM của Z1.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Toàn vẹn kiểm toán (Audit Integrity):&lt;/b&gt; Không có bất kỳ dữ liệu Plaintext hay khóa bí mật nào bị rò rỉ vào hệ thống log (F9).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="680" width="1360" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="page_read" name="3. Luồng Đọc &amp; Tra cứu Bảo mật (Read Pipeline)"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1860" pageHeight="1150" background="#F8FAFC" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="banner3" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;text-align:center;color:#0F172A;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:21px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.5px;color:#D97706;'&gt;QUY TRÌNH ĐỌC HỒ SƠ &amp;amp; TRA CỨU BẢO MẬT (READ &amp;amp; BLIND INDEX PIPELINE)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='margin-top:4px;font-size:12.5px;color:#475569;'&gt;Tra cứu chính xác qua Blind Index HMAC | Gỡ khóa DEK qua Vault KMS | Bắt buộc đối soát AAD &amp;amp; Auth Tag | Safe Projection&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1780" height="65" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rlane_z0" value="&lt;b&gt;VÙNG Z0: CLIENT ENDPOINT&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0F9FF;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0369A1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="105" width="340" height="980" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rlane_z1" value="&lt;b&gt;VÙNG Z1: TRUSTED GATEWAY &amp;amp; KEY BROKER&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0FDF4;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#15803D;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="105" width="780" height="980" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rlane_z2" value="&lt;b&gt;VÙNG Z2: UNTRUSTED CLOUD DBMS&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#B91C1C;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="105" width="350" height="980" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rlane_z3" value="&lt;b&gt;VÙNG Z3: AUDIT&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#334155;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1600" y="105" width="220" height="980" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r1" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#0284C7;color:#FFFFFF;padding:5px 8px;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;'&gt;&lt;span&gt;BƯỚC 1: Truy vấn Tìm kiếm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='background:rgba(0,0,0,0.18);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;DOCTOR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:7px 9px;font-size:10px;color:#334155;line-height:1.4;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;• Bác sĩ gửi yêu cầu tìm hồ sơ theo CCCD hoặc Mã bệnh án.&lt;br/&gt;• Truy vấn gửi qua TLS 1.3 kèm JWT chứa vai trò và khoa viện.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="65" y="160" width="290" height="105" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r2" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#16A34A;color:#FFFFFF;padding:5px 8px;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;'&gt;&lt;span&gt;BƯỚC 2: Kiểm tra PDP &amp;amp; Tính Blind Index&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='background:rgba(0,0,0,0.18);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;GATEWAY &amp;amp; PDP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:7px 9px;font-size:10px;color:#334155;line-height:1.4;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;• Gateway xác thực quyền đọc của Bác sĩ qua &lt;b&gt;PDP&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• Tính toán Blind Index Token: &lt;code&gt;token = HMAC-SHA256(CCCD, salt_tenant)&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• Token là giá trị không thể đảo ngược, dùng để tìm kiếm chính xác (F4).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="160" width="350" height="115" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r3" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#DC2626;color:#FFFFFF;padding:5px 8px;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;'&gt;&lt;span&gt;BƯỚC 3: Truy vấn DB bằng Token&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='background:rgba(0,0,0,0.18);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;CLOUD DBMS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:7px 9px;font-size:10px;color:#334155;line-height:1.4;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;• DB nhận câu lệnh: &lt;code&gt;SELECT * WHERE bidx_cccd = token&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• Cloud DB tìm kiếm chính xác cực nhanh nhưng &lt;b&gt;hoàn toàn không biết giá trị CCCD&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• Trả về các trường dạng &lt;code&gt;FieldEnvelope&lt;/code&gt; và &lt;code&gt;KeyCapsule&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1245" y="160" width="300" height="125" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r4" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#CA8A04;color:#FFFFFF;padding:5px 8px;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;'&gt;&lt;span&gt;BƯỚC 4: Xác thực Quyền Gỡ Khóa (Unwrap)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='background:rgba(0,0,0,0.18);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;KEY BROKER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:7px 9px;font-size:10px;color:#334155;line-height:1.4;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;• Gateway gửi &lt;code&gt;KeyCapsule&lt;/code&gt; và Ngữ cảnh dự kiến sang Key Broker.&lt;br/&gt;• Key Broker đối soát độc lập với PDP và kiểm tra phiên bản tại Trusted Registry.&lt;br/&gt;• Nếu đối soát thất bại &amp;rarr; Từ chối giải mã ngay lập tức.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="340" width="350" height="115" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r5" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#CA8A04;color:#FFFFFF;padding:5px 8px;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;'&gt;&lt;span&gt;BƯỚC 5: Gỡ Khóa DEK An toàn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='background:rgba(0,0,0,0.18);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;VAULT KMS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:7px 9px;font-size:10px;color:#334155;line-height:1.4;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;• Key Broker gọi Vault KMS Unwrap qua kênh an toàn nội bộ Z1.&lt;br/&gt;• Vault dùng Tenant KEK giải mã capsule và trả DEK về cho Key Broker.&lt;br/&gt;• DEK được nạp vào RAM của FieldCipherEngine trong phiên giải mã.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="500" width="350" height="115" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r6" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#16A34A;color:#FFFFFF;padding:5px 8px;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;'&gt;&lt;span&gt;BƯỚC 6: Giải mã &amp;amp; Xác thực Toàn vẹn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='background:rgba(0,0,0,0.18);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;CRYPTO ENGINE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:7px 9px;font-size:10px;color:#334155;line-height:1.4;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;• FieldCipherEngine tính lại Canonical AAD (RFC 8785) từ metadata.&lt;br/&gt;• Bắt buộc xác thực 16-byte GCM Authentication Tag trước khi xuất plaintext.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Nếu có bất kỳ bit nào bị sửa &amp;rarr; Ném DecryptionFailedError (TC-05).&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="500" width="350" height="125" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r7" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#0284C7;color:#FFFFFF;padding:5px 8px;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;'&gt;&lt;span&gt;BƯỚC 7: Chiếu Trường An toàn (Field Projection)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='background:rgba(0,0,0,0.18);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;GATEWAY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:7px 9px;font-size:10px;color:#334155;line-height:1.4;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;• Gateway đối chiếu danh sách trường được phép xem của Bác sĩ theo ABAC.&lt;br/&gt;• Lọc bỏ các trường nhạy cảm không thuộc phạm vi thẩm quyền.&lt;br/&gt;• Trả về Plaintext an toàn cho Bác sĩ trên giao diện xem lâm sàng.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="65" y="500" width="290" height="125" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r8" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#334155;color:#FFFFFF;padding:5px 8px;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;'&gt;&lt;span&gt;BƯỚC 8: Ghi Vết Truy cập F9&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='background:rgba(0,0,0,0.18);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;Z3 AUDIT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:7px 9px;font-size:10px;color:#334155;line-height:1.4;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;• Ghi nhận vết truy cập hồ sơ vào Merkle Audit Log.&lt;br/&gt;• Lưu trữ: ID Bác sĩ (hashed), ID Hồ sơ, Thời gian, Trạng thái giải mã.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1620" y="500" width="180" height="125" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="re1" value="F1: Query Search" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0369A1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="r1" target="r2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="re2" value="F4: Blind Index Token" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#991B1B;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="r2" target="r3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="re3" value="Trả Envelopes + Capsules" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#CA8A04;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#854D0E;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="r3" target="r4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="re4" value="Yêu cầu Unwrap" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#CA8A04;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#854D0E;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="r4" target="r5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="re5" value="Cấp DEK an toàn" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#15803D;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="r5" target="r6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="re6" value="Plaintext hợp lệ" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0369A1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="r6" target="r7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="re7" value="F9 Metadata" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontColor=#475569;fontSize=9;" parent="1" edge="1" source="r6" target="r8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r_sec_box" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;padding:12px;color:#1E293B;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-weight:bold;color:#D97706;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:6px;'&gt;CAM KẾT AN TOÀN TRONG QUY TRÌNH ĐỌC (SECURITY INVARIANTS)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:15px;'&gt;&lt;div&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Bảo vệ trước Rogue DBA (TC-02):&lt;/b&gt; Quản trị viên cơ sở dữ liệu không thể đọc lén dữ liệu qua query trực tiếp vì chỉ thấy Base64 ciphertext vô nghĩa.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Phát hiện can thiệp tức thì (TC-05):&lt;/b&gt; Bất kỳ hành vi sửa đổi bản mã, hoán đổi tenant_id hay tái sử dụng Nonce đều bị GCM Tag phát hiện và từ chối.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Tối thiểu hóa quyền truy cập (Principle of Least Privilege):&lt;/b&gt; Bác sĩ chỉ xem được các trường tương ứng với chuyên khoa điều trị (TC-01, TC-24).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Chống rò rỉ bộ nhớ:&lt;/b&gt; Plaintext và DEK bị xóa khỏi RAM ngay sau khi đóng phiên request.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="680" width="1360" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="page_adv" name="4. Chia sẻ CP-ABE &amp; Tính toán BFV"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1860" pageHeight="1150" background="#F8FAFC" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="banner4" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;text-align:center;color:#0F172A;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:21px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.5px;color:#7C3AED;'&gt;CƠ CHẾ MẬT MÃ NÂNG CAO: CHIA SẺ CP-ABE &amp;amp; TÍNH TOÁN ĐỒNG CẤU SEAL BFV&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='margin-top:4px;font-size:12.5px;color:#475569;'&gt;Profile P2: Chia sẻ dữ liệu liên viện theo chính sách thuộc tính | Profile P3: Tính tổng bảo mật trên bản mã không cần giải mã&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1780" height="65" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="sec_abe" value="&lt;b&gt;PHÂN HỆ 1: CHIA SẺ LIÊN VIỆN QUA CP-ABE (PROFILE P2 - AC17 CP-ABE)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAF5FF;strokeColor=#A855F7;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#6D28D9;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="105" width="870" height="980" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="sec_bfv" value="&lt;b&gt;PHÂN HỆ 2: TÍNH TOÁN ĐỒNG CẤU TRÊN CLOUD (PROFILE P3 - SEAL BFV)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0FDFA;strokeColor=#0D9488;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F766E;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="940" y="105" width="880" height="980" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="abe1" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#7C3AED;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;1. Khởi tạo Thuộc tính &amp;amp; Khóa Bí mật &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;Z1 AA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Attribute Authority (AA)&lt;/b&gt; thiết lập hệ thống AC17 trên Stanford PBC.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Phát hành Public Parameters (PK) cho các bệnh viện.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Cấp phát &lt;code&gt;User_Secret_Key&lt;/code&gt; cho Bác sĩ B dựa trên thuộc tính:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;code&gt;[HOSPITAL_B, ONCOLOGY_DEPT, DOCTOR_SENIOR]&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="160" width="390" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="abe2" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#7C3AED;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;2. Đóng gói &amp;amp; Mã hóa theo Chính sách &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;ENCRYPT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Hospital A muốn chia sẻ hồ sơ bệnh nhân cho khoa Ung bướu BV B.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Gateway mã hóa DEK với chính sách logic cây:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;code&gt;Policy = (HOSPITAL_B AND ONCOLOGY) OR RESEARCHER&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Tạo ra &lt;code&gt;CP-ABE Capsule&lt;/code&gt; lưu kèm gói dữ liệu.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="490" y="160" width="390" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="abe3" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#7C3AED;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;3. Lưu trữ &amp;amp; Phân phối Capsule &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;DISTRIBUTE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Gói chia sẻ gồm &lt;code&gt;FieldEnvelope&lt;/code&gt; và &lt;code&gt;CP-ABE Capsule&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Lưu trữ tại Cloud DBMS hoặc phân phối trực tiếp cho bên nhận.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Kẻ tấn công trên mạng hoặc Cloud không thể mở khóa DEK.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="340" width="390" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="abe4" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#7C3AED;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;4. Giải mã Ngoại tuyến (Recipient SDK) &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;DECRYPT SDK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Bác sĩ B tải gói chia sẻ về máy trạm bằng &lt;b&gt;Recipient SDK&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;SDK dùng &lt;code&gt;User_Secret_Key&lt;/code&gt; để giải mã capsule.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Nếu các thuộc tính thỏa mãn điều kiện logic &amp;rarr; Thu được DEK.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Dùng DEK giải mã hồ sơ bệnh án ngoại tuyến hoàn toàn.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="490" y="340" width="390" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ae1" value="Phát hành Khóa Thuộc tính" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#6D28D9;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="abe1" target="abe4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ae2" value="Mã hóa với Policy" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#6D28D9;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="abe2" target="abe3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ae3" value="Tải bản mã &amp; Capsule" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#6D28D9;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="abe3" target="abe4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="abe_note_box" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;padding:12px;color:#1E293B;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-weight:bold;color:#7C3AED;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:6px;'&gt;ƯU THẾ CỦA CP-ABE TRONG Y TẾ (FINE-GRAINED ACCESS)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;'&gt;• Không cần biết trước danh tính cụ thể của người nhận (Bác sĩ nào trực).&lt;br/&gt;• Quyền truy cập được gắn liền vào bản mã (Policy-embedded Ciphertext).&lt;br/&gt;• Thu hồi quyền linh hoạt và không cần kết nối trực tuyến với bên chia sẻ lúc giải mã.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="520" width="810" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bfv1" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#0D9488;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;1. Mã hóa Dữ liệu Nghiên cứu (BFV) &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;Z1 HE OWNER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;HE Owner (Z1)&lt;/b&gt; khởi tạo cặp khóa BFV (Public Key, Secret Key).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Mã hóa các chỉ số định lượng y tế (Tuổi, Liều thuốc, Huyết áp):&lt;br/&gt;&lt;code&gt;ct_val = BFV.Encrypt(PK, [value_1, value_2, ...])&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;Chỉ gửi bản mã &lt;code&gt;ct_val&lt;/code&gt; lên Cloud Worker.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="160" width="390" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bfv2" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#0D9488;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;2. Tính toán trên Bản mã tại Cloud &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;Z2 SEAL WORKER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;SEAL BFV Worker (Z2)&lt;/b&gt; tiếp nhận các bản mã từ nhiều bệnh viện.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Thực hiện phép tính tổng đồng cấu (Homomorphic Addition):&lt;br/&gt;&lt;code&gt;ct_sum = BFV.Add(ct_1, ct_2, ct_3, ...)&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;Worker hoàn toàn không biết giá trị thực và không thể giải mã!&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="160" width="390" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bfv3" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#0D9488;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;3. Trả về Kết quả Tổng Mã hóa &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;RESULT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Cloud Worker gửi kết quả mã hóa &lt;code&gt;ct_sum&lt;/code&gt; về cho HE Owner.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Không có bất kỳ thông tin riêng tư nào của bệnh nhân bị lộ cho Cloud.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;Bảo vệ 100% quyền riêng tư theo tiêu chuẩn y tế quốc tế.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="340" width="390" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bfv4" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;'&gt;&lt;div style='background-color:#0D9488;color:#FFFFFF;padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;'&gt;4. Giải mã Thống kê tại Miền Tin cậy &lt;span style='float:right;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;font-size:9px;'&gt;DECRYPT RESULT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='padding:8px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.45;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:0 0 5px 5px;'&gt;&lt;ul style='margin:0;padding-left:14px;list-style-type:square;'&gt;&lt;li style='margin-bottom:3px;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;HE Owner (Z1)&lt;/b&gt; dùng Secret Key của mình để giải mã:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;code&gt;sum_result = BFV.Decrypt(SK, ct_sum)&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;Thu được kết quả thống kê lâm sàng chính xác tuyệt đối mà không vi phạm bảo mật.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="340" width="390" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="be1" value="Gửi Ciphertext" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#0D9488;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F766E;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="bfv1" target="bfv2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="be2" value="Tính BFV.Add()" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#0D9488;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F766E;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="bfv2" target="bfv3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="be3" value="Trả ct_sum" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#0D9488;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F766E;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="bfv3" target="bfv4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bfv_note_box" value="&lt;div style='font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,sans-serif;padding:12px;color:#1E293B;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-weight:bold;color:#0D9488;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:6px;'&gt;ỨNG DỤNG HOMOMORPHIC ENCRYPTION TRONG Y TẾ (PRIVACY-PRESERVING)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;'&gt;• Cho phép các bệnh viện hợp tác nghiên cứu dịch tễ học mà không cần chia sẻ dữ liệu gốc.&lt;br/&gt;• Máy chủ Cloud thực hiện tính toán thống kê nặng nề mà không thể xem trộm hồ sơ.&lt;br/&gt;• Tuân thủ nghiêm ngặt các quy định HIPAA, GDPR và Nghị định 13/2023/NĐ-CP.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=6;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="520" width="820" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>